<title>USA: IPO PRICING - ASI prices within range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - ASI prices within range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		  ASI Solutions Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $6</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	    $6 - $6.50</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			1,800,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter   H.C. Wainwright &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The estimated price range for the planned initial public offering in ASI Solutions Inc was reduced to $6 to $6.50 per common share from $7 to $8.</p>
<p>The number of shares proposed for initial public offering fell to 1.8 million shares from 2.2 million shares initially.</p>
</text>
